# Send only immutable source inputs and the optional public Locksmith
# deployment artifacts consumed by Containerfile. In particular, never send
# .env, private keyrings, Cargo build output, or a locally-built canaryctl.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!crates/**
!migrations/
!migrations/**
!canary.json
!.caution/
!.caution/quorum-bundle.json
!.caution/secrets/
!.caution/secrets/CANARY_MASTER_SEED.asc
